0..75 Comment "// What forgetting a manifest carrier refuses: a model of a theory with the"
76..152 Comment "// counter\'s carrier but not its reading is no counter once forgotten, and a"
153..226 Comment "// model fixing one sort is no model fixing another (#2132). Two counters"
227..301 Comment "// whose carriers are not shared do not mix, and a counter has no sort but"
302..376 Comment "// its carrier (#2131). A pairing whose second carrier is its own does not"
377..452 Comment "// share another\'s (#2158). A counter\'s operation read off its binder steps"
453..530 Comment "// only that counter\'s counts, and a counter has no operation but its own and"
531..579 Comment "// no field at a carrier its type fixes (#2246)."
580..654 Comment "// `../../model/identity/model-counter-manifest.gandr` forgets a counter\'s"
655..730 Comment "// manifest carrier, a counter\'s manifest readings alone, and a carrier two"
731..807 Comment "// counters share, or two pairings fixing their first, and reads a counter\'s"
808..837 Comment "// operations off its binder."
839..894 Comment "// The counter, and `observe`, which reads any counter."
895..901 Keyword "import"
902..903 StringLit "\""
903..943 StringLit "../../model/identity/model-counter.gandr"
943..944 StringLit "\""
